# Copy to .env for local dev (`pnpm dev:frontend`). Never commit the real file.
#
# Vite bakes VITE_* into the built bundle at build time — these are not read
# at request time, so they must be set here (or in CI, see deploy.yml) before
# building, not as Worker vars.
#
# The domain your redirect worker serves short links from — used to build the
# "copy short URL" links shown in the Links table.
VITE_SHORT_DOMAIN=example.com
# The hostname this admin app (and admin-api) are deployed to — shown as the
# Access application scope on the Service tokens page.
VITE_ADMIN_DOMAIN=links.example.com
